        "original_id": "e2cd09f3-95e4-52cf-b07b-34bc73e70cb9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Hart, Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, J. F. Lawton\n- Films and TV: Under Siege, Marked for Death, Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death, Pizza Man, V.I.P.\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Sound\n- Places and Systems: USS Missouri, U.S. Navy\n- Roles and Concepts: ex-Navy SEAL, mercenaries, former DEA troubleshooter, screenwriter, director, assumed name J.D. Athens\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Hart was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Sound for the film Under Siege.\n- Under Siege stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop mercenaries led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey on the U.S. Navy battleship USS Missouri.\n- J. F. Lawton received screen credits for Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, Under Siege, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, and the TV series V.I.P.\n- J. F. Lawton used the assumed name J.D. Athens when he wrote and directed Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death and Pizza Man.\n- Marked for Death stars Steven Seagal as John Hatcher, a former DEA troubleshooter.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
